      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:y37giw'
    '|a||Sikh prisoners at first swapped their tinned beef for almost any other food, until they learned to ask for jam and margarine.':
