      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1yh1lun'
    '|b||A young economist in the camp, R. A. Radford, wrote it up in 1945: everyone got a roughly equal share, and it was by trade that individual preferences were given expression and comfort increased.':
