      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1jbuej3'
    '|a||So swapping alone makes people better off. Where does it stop, and is there one best place to stop?':
      mp3: 
