      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:rduyij'
    '|b||To answer that, we need one picture that holds two people''s things at once.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:yiwyp2'
    '|b||Take two people in Harbourtown, with illustrative numbers: Mia the baker and Finn, a fisher. Between them they have ten fish and ten loaves.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8880
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|b||This box holds all of it. Mia counts from the bottom-left corner: fish to the right, loaves up.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:17sa2zk'
    '|a||And Finn?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:t8fgn'
    '|b||From the top-right corner, upside down: his fish run to the left, his loaves down. So every point in the box splits all twenty things between them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10320
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:11uor35'
    '|b||They start here. Mia has two fish and eight loaves; Finn has eight fish and two loaves.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1gsf5k2'
    '|a||So she''s rich in bread and he''s rich in fish. What does each of them care about?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1xqajut'
    '|b||Mia''s curve through the start joins every split she likes exactly as much. Anything above it, she prefers.':
