      ms: 7040
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:7lba3a'
    '|b||Finn''s curve through the same point bows the other way. He prefers anything below it, further from his own corner.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7000
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1gcaz7c'
    '|a||Here are three deals they could strike. Only one makes both better off.':
