      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1vinj0y'
    '|a||Which deal leaves both Mia and Finn better off than at the start? Tap it.':
