      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1f29eci'
    '|a||The lens holds every swap that helps both. Once they''re at five and five, can they do better still?':
