      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:3bjqp2'
    '|a||So no lens is left. Any swap from here that helps Mia hurts Finn: the deal is Pareto efficient.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1mp0rzb'
    '|b||So five and five is the answer?':
