      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1fp67sr'
    '|a||One answer of many. Move the deal along, and at every point the two curves touch again.':
