      ms: 6400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:c9xfc9'
    '|a||Join the touching points and you get a line from Mia''s corner to Finn''s. Francis Edgeworth, in 1881, called it the contract curve.':
